Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:03:16.51,Watermark,,0,0,0,,PSYCHO BUSINESS · CHANTER
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.35,0:00:02.24,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Black car, no lights
Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.24,0:00:04.12,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Phone dead, deal live
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.12,0:00:06.01,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,No sleep, still sharp
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.01,0:00:09.31,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Whole room goes quiet\Nwhen I walk
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.66,0:00:13.96,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I don’t chase names,\NI acquire leverage
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.96,0:00:17.73,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Smile too clean, but\Nthe mind too dangerous
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.73,0:00:21.51,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Numbers on numbers, I\Nstack them in silence
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.51,0:00:25.28,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,You call it obsession,\NI call it compliance
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.28,0:00:29.05,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Three missed calls, I\Ndon’t owe no reply
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.05,0:00:33.77,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,If it don’t make money,\Nlet the whole thing die
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.77,0:00:37.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Suit with a heartbeat\Ncold as the floor
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.54,0:00:42.73,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I came for the building, not\Na seat by the door
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.73,0:00:46.03,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Everybody friendly when the\Ngraph goes green
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.03,0:00:49.33,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Everybody genius when the\Nrisk ain’t seen
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.33,0:00:53.10,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I was in the\Ndark making moves unseen
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.10,0:00:56.88,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now the same motherfuckers\Nwanna join the team
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.23,0:01:00.58,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,No emotion in the contract
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.58,0:01:02.94,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,No confusion in the roadmap
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.94,0:01:06.71,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,If I said it,\Nthen I own that
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.71,0:01:09.07,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,One move — ten doors open
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.42,0:01:11.37,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Psycho business
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.37,0:01:12.31,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Psycho business
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.31,0:01:16.08,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Money on my mind\Nlike a medical condition
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.08,0:01:17.02,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Psycho business
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.02,0:01:17.97,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,No permission
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.97,0:01:21.74,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I don’t need applause,\NI need ownership positions
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.74,0:01:22.68,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Cold decisions
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.68,0:01:23.63,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Clean execution
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.63,0:01:26.93,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Turn a little pressure\Ninto global distribution
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.93,0:01:27.87,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Psycho business
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.87,0:01:28.81,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Psycho business
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.81,0:01:33.53,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,If the world is a\Nmachine, I want root permissions
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.88,0:01:38.18,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I don’t want fame,\NI want infrastructure
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.18,0:01:41.95,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I don’t want noise,\NI want market structure
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.95,0:01:45.73,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I don’t need twenty\Npeople in the room
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.73,0:01:50.44,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Give me one good system,\Nwatch the whole thing bloom
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.44,0:01:54.21,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Every loss gets logged,\Nevery scar gets priced
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.21,0:01:57.04,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Every bad year turned to enterprise
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.04,0:02:01.29,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I don’t pray for luck,\NI engineer the odds
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.29,0:02:04.59,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Build once, sell twice,\Nautomate the job
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.59,0:02:07.42,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,They’re posting quotes, I’m closing gaps
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.42,0:02:10.25,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,They’re chasing trends, I’m building maps
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.25,0:02:13.08,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,They need attention every fucking day
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.08,0:02:16.85,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I need one machine\Nthat keeps getting paid
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.20,0:02:19.14,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,More control
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.14,0:02:20.09,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Less noise
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.09,0:02:21.03,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,More assets
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.03,0:02:21.97,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Less choice
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.97,0:02:22.92,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,One company
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.92,0:02:23.86,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Many hands
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.86,0:02:24.80,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,No panic
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.80,0:02:25.75,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Just plans
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.10,0:02:28.51,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Own the stack
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.51,0:02:29.93,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Own the flow
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.93,0:02:31.34,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Own the data
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.34,0:02:32.76,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Own the growth
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.76,0:02:34.17,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Own the growth
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.17,0:02:35.59,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Cut the drag
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.59,0:02:37.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Raise the floor
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.00,0:02:37.94,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,One decision
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.94,0:02:39.83,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Makes a hundred more
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.18,0:02:42.12,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Psycho business
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.12,0:02:43.07,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Psycho business
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.07,0:02:46.84,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Money on my mind\Nlike a medical condition
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.84,0:02:47.78,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Psycho business
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.78,0:02:48.72,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Pure precision
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.72,0:02:52.03,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Every little move becomes\Na larger system
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.03,0:02:52.97,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Cold decisions
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.97,0:02:53.91,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Clean execution
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.91,0:02:57.21,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Turn a private obsession\Ninto mass distribution
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.21,0:02:58.16,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Psycho business
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.16,0:02:59.10,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Psycho business
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.10,0:03:01.93,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I don’t wanna run the race—
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.93,0:03:04.29,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I wanna own the system.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.64,0:03:06.58,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,No sleep
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.58,0:03:07.52,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,No noise
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.52,0:03:08.47,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,No boss
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.47,0:03:09.41,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,My choice
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.41,0:03:10.82,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Build it once
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.82,0:03:12.24,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Let it run
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.24,0:03:14.60,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,When they finally see it—
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.60,0:03:16.01,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,It’s already done.
